{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bizta Digital COO API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Bizta - AI Digital COO Backend\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the `baseUrl` variable to `http://localhost:3000/api/v1`\n3. After login/register, the access token is automatically saved to `accessToken` variable\n4. Protected endpoints use the `accessToken` automatically\n\n## Authentication Flow\n1. **Register** → Creates user + organization → Returns tokens\n2. **Login** → Returns access + refresh tokens\n3. **Get Current User** → Use access token to get user info\n4. **Refresh Token** → Get new access token using refresh token\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:3000/api/v1\n- `accessToken`: (auto-set after login/register)\n- `refreshToken`: (auto-set after login/register)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "bizta-digital-coo"
  },
