            "description": "Register a new user and organization.\n\n**Public endpoint** - No authentication required.\n\n### What it does:\n1. Creates a new user account\n2. Creates a new organization (auto-named after user)\n3. Creates membership (role: OWNER)\n4. Creates default organization settings\n5. Returns JWT access + refresh tokens\n\n### Request Body:\n- `email` (required): Valid email address\n- `password` (required): Min 8 characters\n- `firstName` (required): Min 2 characters\n- `lastName` (required): Min 2 characters\n\n### Response:\n- User object\n- Organization object\n- Access token (15min expiry)\n- Refresh token (7 day expiry)"
          },
