            "description": "Get current authenticated user's profile.\n\n**Protected endpoint** - Requires valid access token.\n\n### Authentication:\nPass access token in `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.\n\n### What it does:\n1. Validates JWT token\n2. Loads user + organization + settings\n3. Returns complete user context\n\n### Response:\n- User object\n- Organization object (from JWT's orgId)\n- Organization settings\n\n### Use Case:\nCall this after login to verify token and get user context for your frontend app."
