            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Get a new access token using refresh token.\n\n**Public endpoint** - No authentication required (uses refresh token instead).\n\n### What it does:\n1. Validates refresh token\n2. Checks user's membership is still active\n3. Issues new access token (15min expiry)\n\n### Request Body:\n- `refreshToken` (required): Valid refresh token from login/register\n\n### Response:\n- New access token\n\n### Use Case:\nWhen access token expires (15min), use this endpoint to get a new one without requiring the user to login again. Refresh tokens last 7 days.\n\n### Security:\n- Validates user still has active membership in organization\n- Refresh token expiry: 7 days\n- Access token expiry: 15 minutes"
          },
