        {
          "name": "Receive Webhook Message",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Generate HMAC SHA256 signature",
                  "const webhookSecret = pm.collectionVariables.get('webhookSecret');",
                  "const body = pm.request.body.raw;",
                  "",
                  "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(body, webhookSecret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('calculatedSignature', 'sha256=' + signature);",
                  "console.log('Generated signature:', 'sha256=' + signature);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Hub-Signature-256",
                "value": "{{calculatedSignature}}",
                "description": "HMAC SHA256 signature (auto-generated in pre-request script)"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"object\": \"whatsapp_business_account\",\n  \"entry\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"123456789\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"messages\",\n          \"value\": {\n            \"messaging_product\": \"whatsapp\",\n            \"messages\": [\n              {\n                \"from\": \"1234567890\",\n                \"id\": \"wamid.test123\",\n                \"timestamp\": \"1700000000\",\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"text\": {\n                  \"body\": \"Hello from Postman!\"\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/whatsapp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "whatsapp"]
            },
            "description": "Receive WhatsApp webhook messages.\n\n**Public endpoint** - No authentication required (uses signature verification).\n\n### What it does:\n1. Verifies HMAC SHA256 signature\n2. Normalizes Meta's payload to BiztaEvent\n3. Stores event in database\n4. Enqueues job to Redis (agent-events queue)\n5. Agent processor handles the event\n\n### Headers:\n- `X-Hub-Signature-256` - HMAC SHA256 signature (auto-generated)\n\n### Body:\nMeta's webhook payload format with message data.\n\n### Flow:\nWebhook → Signature Check → Normalize → DB Event → Redis Queue → Agent\n\n### Pre-request Script:\nAutomatically generates signature using `webhookSecret` variable.\n\n### Response:\n`{\"status\": \"ok\"}` on success"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "X-Hub-Signature-256",
                    "value": "sha256=..."
                  }
                ],
